config RYONG_NAMED_MACRO
    bool "Keys bound to a runtime macro by its name"
    default y
    depends on ZMK_RUNTIME_MACRO && DT_HAS_RYONG_BEHAVIOR_NAMED_RUNTIME_MACRO_ENABLED
    help
      Lets a keymap keep `&BT_Profile0` style bindings while the macro itself
      is a runtime macro (editable in the web app). The key looks the macro up
      by name when pressed, so adding or removing other macros never changes
      which macro the key plays.
